abstract: >
  Time-indexed (trajectory) extension of the Risk Mechanism Theory Index (RMTI). Adds a filtered V(t) and rho(t) layer on top of the unchanged RMTI core, R = L*E*V*(1-rho), with a Python reference implementation, Excel calculators and interactive sandboxes for oncology (HCC surveillance) and disaster science. Research prototype: parameters are uncalibrated and the method has not been validated against real outcomes.
